    title: "Strategic Management of Black Enterprises",
    units: 0.5,
    description: "Current real-world challenges in the strategic management of start-ups, technological innovation, and social enterprises are addressed through the lens of Black studies. Students will work collaboratively to address the topics to be pursued, including both cultural and business/economic aspects.",
