    code: "CHE 101",
    title: "Chemical Engineering Concepts 2",
    units: 0.5,
    description: "Development of chemical process analysis skills. Introduction to single- and multi-phase physical equilibria. Material and energy balances in reactive and non-reactive systems. Introduction to investigation and technical communication through laboratory experiments illustrating the physical principles discussed. In the winter term only: brief review of co-op fundamentals.",
