    units: 0.5,
    description: "This interdisciplinary course integrates science and policy issues to consider coastal systems as dynamic and linked systems of people and nature. Course content and case studies emphasize key challenges and drivers of change in coastal systems, as well as frameworks and approaches to understand and sustainably govern coastal settings.",
